OL,3,GNEWSAWeaver Network fleet takes shape
OL,4,Aon factory floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a cavernous factory 25 miles north
OL,7,Fof Belfast a row of double decker buses
OL,8,Fare queuing on the assembly line.
OL,10,FAt various stages of completion the
OL,11,Fvehicles are among the first to be
OL,12,Fbuilt for West Yorkshire's publicly
OL,13,Fcontrolled Weaver Network.
OL,15,FThe buses are still several months away
OL,16,Ffrom picking up their first passengers
OL,17,F` some have roofs on, others are little
OL,18,Fmore than the bare bones of a steel
OL,19,Fchassis.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
