OL,3,GNEWSAWeaver Network fleet takes shape
OL,4,Aon factory floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the coming months, a fleet of 193
OL,7,Fof the fully electric vehicles will
OL,8,Froll off the production line before
OL,9,Fbeing shipped across the Irish Sea and
OL,10,Fput to work in West Yorkshire.
